# Input
```vue
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<template>
  <my-component inline-template><div /></my-component>
  <my-component inline-template=""><div /></my-component>
  <my-component inline-template="foo"><div /></my-component>
  <MyComponent inline-template>
    <div>{{ message }}</div>
  </MyComponent>
  <div>
    <my-component class="a" inline-template v-if="ok"><span /></my-component>
  </div>
</template>

```

# Diagnostics
```
invalid.vue:3:17 lint/nursery/noVueDeprecatedInlineTemplate ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × The inline-template attribute is not supported in Vue 3.
  
    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
    2 │ <template>
  > 3 │   <my-component inline-template><div /></my-component>
      │                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    4 │   <my-component inline-template=""><div /></my-component>
    5 │   <my-component inline-template="foo"><div /></my-component>
  
  i Vue 3 no longer uses the content between the component's tags as its template. The component only shows that content if its template has a <slot>.
  
  i Move the content into the component's own template, or pass it to the component through a slot.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

```

